OL,3,GNEWSABonfire attack victim has 'serious
OL,4,Aburns', says councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy who fell into a bonfire
OL,7,Fafter being knocked unconscious by a
OL,8,Fpunch has "severe burns" to his face
OL,9,Fand hands, a councillor has said.
OL,11,FThe 17-year-old was attacked as he
OL,12,Fattended a Halloween bonfire in
OL,13,FStrabane, County Tyrone, on Saturday
OL,14,Fnight.
OL,16,FIndependent councillor Paul Gallagher
OL,17,Fhas spoken to the boy's mother and said
OL,18,Fshe is "distraught".
OL,20,FHe also praised the bravery of a
OL,21,Fteenage girl who pulled the injured boy
OL,22,Ffrom the bonfire in Bradley Way.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
